{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 19, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark good traveler to Japan’s fair and wondrous isle\nWhere cherry blossoms weep and ancient temples rise\nLet me spin thee a course with words both grand and bright\nSo heed my counsel and with joy take flight\n\nUpon thy morn in Tokyo thou shalt awake\nThe bustling streets of Shinjuku do not forsake\nTo Asakusa’s temple gates thou shalt repair\nWhere lanterns dance in twilight’s soft and fragrant air\n\nWith sumo’s mighty warriors thou shalt take thy fill\nIn Ryogoku’s halls where strength and grace do dwell\nThen to Ginza’s glow where shops of gold and light\nShall tempt thy purse with treasures rare and bright\n\nOn to Nikko’s halls where gods in stone do tread\nAnd Kegon Falls like silk by ancient woods are spread\nThen unto Hakone where hot springs do call\nTo soothe thy bones and cleanse thy weary soul\n\nO weary sojourner take not pause nor rest\nFor Kyoto’s allure awaits thee at thy quest\nThrough Arashiyama’s groves where monkeys play\nAnd bamboo stands in whispers as they sway\n\nNishiki’s market shall thy hunger’s edge assuage\nWith sushi fresh and matcha sweets that taste of age\nFushimi’s sake thou shalt imbibe with care\nFrom breweries old where time itself doth fare\n\nTo Nara’s deer that bow with gentle grace\nAnd Todai’s giant buddha who doth watch o’er place\nThen unto Hiroshima where peace doth dwell\nAnd Miyajima’s island where torii stands so well\n\nIn Osaka’s heart where street food doth abound\nWith takoyaki balls that fizz and dance around\nTo Dotonbori’s neon where the night takes flight\nAnd love hotels gleam like stars in dead of night\n\nThou shalt not linger long in cities fair and grand\nFor Osaka Castle’s stones still hold the warrior’s hand\nThen south to Kumamoto where castle’s tower’s might\nDoth stand defiant o’er the lands of old and right\n\nLast unto Okinawa’s shores so warm and bright\nWhere coral reefs in sapphire waters take their light\nAnd ryukyu’s dances move with grace untold\nAs thy grand journey through this land of dreams unfold\n\nThus ends thy sojourn through Japan’s embrace\nA land of wonder where each step finds its place\nMay fortune smile upon thy path anew\nAnd memories of honor evermore imbue.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.003225721186026931}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -2.0492587089538574}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.4956902861595154}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0005230727256275713}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.2813615798950195}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.213939905166626}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.4407646954059601}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.2200459986925125}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.8202966451644897}, {"token": " w", "logprob": -1.0655033588409424}, {"token": "ond", "logprob": -7.879423355916515e-05}, {"token": "rous", "logprob": -0.0021080193109810352}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -2.1284520626068115}, {"token": "le", "logprob": -0.0889928936958313}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.16781330108642578}, {"token": "Where", "logprob": -0.6017629504203796}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.26684460043907166}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.13737156987190247}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.003676324151456356}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -3.0447888374328613}, {"token": "ep", "logprob": -0.019804010167717934}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.6215153336524963}, {"token": " ancient", "logprob": -2.092606544494629}, {"token": " temples", "logprob": -0.5655986666679382}, {"token": " rise", "logprob": -3.131540060043335}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.6097120642662048}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -1.1818046569824219}, {"token": " me", "logprob": -1.2918941974639893}, {"token": " spin", "logprob": -1.387367844581604}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.16992077231407166}, {"token": "e", "logprob": -0.0036803623661398888}, {"token": " a", "logpr